# Nyumba – PeaceTech Community Trust Ledger

Built during the Andela x OpenAI Codex Accelerator.  
**Offline‑first | Anonymous witnesses | Conflict intelligence**

## Installation

bash
git clone <your-repo>
cd nyumba
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -e .

## Run the server

python -m src.nyumba.server
# or after fixing entry point: nyumba serve

## CLI usage (offline)


nyumba add --text "Share water" --location "Goma" --participants "A,B"
nyumba witness <id> --yes
nyumba receipt <id>
